tandardbrawl":"not_legal","timeless":"legal","tlr":"legal","vintage":"legal"},"loyalty":null,"mana_cost":"{B}","name":"Reanimate","oracle_id":"a044474a-cd72-4e9d-bd8d-a08f2de9cdc0","oracle_text":"Put target creature card from a graveyard onto the battlefield under your control. You lose life equal to that card's mana value.","power":null,"produced_mana":[],"released_at":"2024-09-27","toughness":null,"type_line":"Sorcery"},{"cmc":2.0,"color_identity":["W"],"colors":["W"],"defense":null,"keywords":[],"layout":"normal","legalities":{"alchemy":"not_legal","brawl":"legal","commander":"legal","competitivebrawl":"legal","duel":"legal","future":"not_legal","gladiator":"legal","historic":"legal","legacy":"legal","modern":"legal","oathbreaker":"legal","oldschool":"not_legal","pauper":"not_legal","paupercommander":"not_legal","penny":"legal","pioneer":"legal","predh":"not_legal","premodern":"not_legal","standard":"legal","standardbrawl":"legal","timeless":"legal","tlr":"legal","vintage":"legal"},"loyalty":null,"mana_cost":"{1}{W}","name":"Rest in Peace","oracle_id":"087f9ad7-e74f-40e2-8102-1ed2925d0418","oracle_text":"When this enchantment enters, exile all graveyards.\nIf a card or token would be put into a graveyard from anywhere, exile it instead.","power":null,"produced_mana":[],"released_at":"2024-04-19","toughness":null,"type_line":"Enchantment"},{"cmc":1.0,"color_identity":[],"colors":[],"defense":null,"keywords":[],"layout":"normal","legalities":{"alchemy":"not_legal","brawl":"not_legal","commander":"legal","competitivebrawl":"not_legal","duel":"banned","future":"not_legal","gladiator":"not_legal","historic":"not_legal","legacy":"banned","modern":"not_legal","oathbreaker":"banned","oldschool":"not_legal","pauper":"not_legal","paupercommander":"not_legal","penny":"not_legal","pioneer":"not_legal","predh":"legal","premodern":"not_legal","standard":"not_legal","standardbrawl":"not_legal","timeless":"not_legal","tlr":"banned","vintage":"restricted"},"loyalty":null,"mana_cost":"{1}","name":"Sol Ring","oracle_id":"6ad8011d-3471-4369-9d68-b264cc027487","oracle_text":"{T}: Add {C}{C}.","power":null,"produced_mana":["C"],"released_at":"2026-06-26","toughness":null,"type_line":"Artifact"},{"cmc":4.0,"color_identity":[],"colors":[],"defense":null,"keywords":[],"layout":"normal","legalities":{"alchemy":"not_legal","brawl":"not_legal","commander":"legal","competitivebrawl":"not_legal","duel":"legal","future":"not_legal","gladiator":"not_legal","historic":"not_legal","legacy":"legal","modern":"legal","oathbreaker":"legal","oldschool":"not_legal","pauper":"not_legal","paupercommander":"not_legal","penny":"legal","pioneer":"not_legal","predh":"legal","premodern":"not_legal","standard":"not_legal","standardbrawl":"not_legal","timeless":"not_legal","tlr":"not_legal","vintage":"legal"},"loyalty":null,"mana_cost":"{4}","name":"Vedalken Orrery","oracle_id":"60d640a4-032b-4279-ac75-8f200ca776fb","oracle_text":"You may cast spells as though they had flash.","power":null,"produced_mana":[],"released_at":"2022-07-08","toughness":null,"type_line":"Artifact"}],"fixture_kind":"public_exact-list_card_data","rulings":[{"comment":"If you Donate an Aura, it stays where it is, but the targeted player now controls it.","oracle_id":"049d1fb2-cce7-40e7-a633-e84cf9782d89","published_at":"2004-10-04","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"If Rest in Peace is destroyed by a spell, Rest in Peace will be exiled and then the spell will be put into its owner's graveyard.","oracle_id":"087f9ad7-e74f-40e2-8102-1ed2925d0418","published_at":"2018-03-16","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"If a card is discarded while Rest in Peace is on the battlefield, abilities that function when a card is discarded (such as madness) still work, even though that card never reaches a graveyard. In addition, spells or abilities that check the characteristics of a discarded card (such as Chandra Ablaze's first ability) can find that card in exile.","oracle_id":"087f9ad7-e74f-40e2-8102-1ed2925d0418","published_at":"2018-03-16","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"While Rest in Peace is on the battlefield, abilities that trigger whenever a creature dies won't trigger because cards and tokens are never put into a player's graveyard.","oracle_id":"087f9ad7-e74f-40e2-8102-1ed2925d0418","published_at":"2018-03-16","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"The controller of Vedalken Orrery can cast nonland artifact, creature, enchantment, and sorcery cards any time they could cast an instant. This includes on other players' turns and during the upkeep step, draw step, combat phase, and end step.","oracle_id":"60d640a4-032b-4279-ac75-8f200ca776fb","published_at":"2004-12-01","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"This applies only to casting spells. It does not, for example, change when you may activate abilities that can only be activated \"any time you could cast a sorcery\".","oracle_id":"60d640a4-032b-4279-ac75-8f200ca776fb","published_at":"2010-06-15","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"If a token is exiled this way, it will cease to exist and won't return to the battlefield.","oracle_id":"6879f5ce-7a1b-4606-bad1-885779b0d456","published_at":"2018-03-16","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"Once the exiled permanent returns, it's considered a new object with no relation to the object that it was. Auras attached to the exiled permanent will be put into their owners' graveyards. Equipment attached to the exiled permanent will become unattached and remain on the battlefield. Any counters on the exiled permanent will cease to exist.","oracle_id":"6879f5ce-7a1b-4606-bad1-885779b0d456","published_at":"2018-03-16","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"The returned card won't be the target of any spells or abilities that targeted it before. Any spells that don't target, such as Akroma's Vengeance, will still affect it.","oracle_id":"6879f5ce-7a1b-4606-bad1-885779b0d456","published_at":"2018-03-16","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"When an effect returns the exiled card \"under your control,\" you control it indefinitely after that. In a multiplayer game, if a player leaves the game, all cards that player owns leave as well. If you leave the game, any creatures you control from Cloudshift's effect are exiled.","oracle_id":"6879f5ce-7a1b-4606-bad1-885779b0d456","published_at":"2018-03-16","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"If a card in a graveyard has {X} in its mana cost, X is 0.","oracle_id":"a044474a-cd72-4e9d-bd8d-a08f2de9cdc0","published_at":"2025-09-19","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"If any abilities trigger on the creature entering the battlefield, those abilities resolve after you lose life. If losing life results in you losing the game, those abilities won't resolve.","oracle_id":"a044474a-cd72-4e9d-bd8d-a08f2de9cdc0","published_at":"2025-09-19","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"In a multiplayer game, if a player leaves the game, all cards that player owns leave as well. If you leave the game, the creature you control from Reanimate is exiled.","oracle_id":"a044474a-cd72-4e9d-bd8d-a08f2de9cdc0","published_at":"2025-09-19","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"The amount of life you lose is determined by the mana value of the card in your graveyard, not the creature once it's on the battlefield.","oracle_id":"a044474a-cd72-4e9d-bd8d-a08f2de9cdc0","published_at":"2025-09-19","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"You lose life after the creature is already on the battlefield. Any abilities it has that interact with loss of life, such as that of Platinum Emperion, apply to that loss of life.","oracle_id":"a044474a-cd72-4e9d-bd8d-a08f2de9cdc0","published_at":"2025-09-19","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"If Kaya’s Ghostform and the enchanted permanent are both put into graveyards and/or exiled at the same time, the enchanted permanent will be returned to the battlefield.","oracle_id":"b15c6203-6311-44eb-916d-a4c271960c74","published_at":"2019-05-03","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"If Kaya’s Ghostform enchants a permanent you control but don’t own, that permanent will return to the battlefield under your control when it dies or is exiled. In a multiplayer game, if a player leaves the game, all cards that player owns leave as well. If you leave the game, any creatures you control from Kaya’s Ghostform’s effect are exiled.","oracle_id":"b15c6203-6311-44eb-916d-a4c271960c74","published_at":"2019-05-03","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"If an effect exiles the enchanted permanent and immediately returns it to the battlefield, the last ability of Kaya’s Ghostform triggers but will have no effect. If an effect exiles the enchanted permanent and would return it to the battlefield at a later time, Kaya’s Ghostform will return that card to the battlefield and it won’t be returned later.","oracle_id":"b15c6203-6311-44eb-916d-a4c271960c74","published_at":"2019-05-03","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"If another player gains control of the enchanted permanent, Kaya’s Ghostform will be put into your graveyard.","oracle_id":"b15c6203-6311-44eb-916d-a4c271960c74","published_at":"2019-05-03","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"If the enchanted permanent is put into a graveyard or exile but leaves that zone before the last ability of Kaya’s Ghostform resolves, that card stays in its new zone, even if that zone is also a graveyard or exile. You don’t return it to the battlefield.","oracle_id":"b15c6203-6311-44eb-916d-a4c271960c74","published_at":"2019-05-03","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"Kaya’s Ghostform can enchant a token, but its last ability won’t return the token to the battlefield.","oracle_id":"b15c6203-6311-44eb-916d-a4c271960c74","published_at":"2019-05-03","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"Kaya’s Ghostform is put into your graveyard once the enchanted permanent leaves the battlefield. It doesn’t return to the battlefield with that permanent.","oracle_id":"b15c6203-6311-44eb-916d-a4c271960c74","published_at":"2019-05-03","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"If there are fewer than twenty cards in the targeted player's library, that player puts all the cards from their library into their graveyard.","oracle_id":"cc2b6e58-2d6f-495e-95f3-9496105c4cba","published_at":"2009-10-01","source":"wotc"}],"schema_version":1,"source":"Scryfall Oracle/rulings subset for offline tests"}
